S6  Signed side E_- (3n-1): leaf identity, drift table, cycles, Q1_-/Q2_-
==============================================================================
PROVED (S6.1): in E_- the new arrows are even 2j -> 6j-1 (targets exactly 5 mod 6); the target v
  has least odd T_- predecessor n0=(4v+1)/3 = 7 mod 8 with 3n0-1=4v, and 2j=(v+1)/3=R_-^{-1}(n0),
  R_-(n)=4n-1.  Targets 1 mod 6 and 3 mod 6 get nothing new; 3Z is again a transient forest.
  minus drift table (inverse move m -> (2^k m + 1)/3, result not 0 mod 3):
     m = 1 mod 9: k_min=1 factor=2/3 result mod 3 = 1   [= plus table at 9-1=8]
     m = 2 mod 9: k_min=0 factor=1/3 result mod 3 = 1   [= plus table at 9-2=7]
     m = 4 mod 9: k_min=3 factor=8/3 result mod 3 = 2   [= plus table at 9-4=5]
     m = 5 mod 9: k_min=0 factor=1/3 result mod 3 = 2   [= plus table at 9-5=4]
     m = 7 mod 9: k_min=1 factor=2/3 result mod 3 = 2   [= plus table at 9-7=2]
     m = 8 mod 9: k_min=2 factor=4/3 result mod 3 = 2   [= plus table at 9-8=1]
PROVED (S6.2): k_-(r) = k_+(9-r): negation conjugates the two drift tables, so the greedy
  Markov chain, E[2^K_J]=3(7/3)^(J-1), and the density-1 greedy stopping theorem transfer verbatim.
  Hostile family: m = 3^j - 1 (m = -1 mod 3^j): j-1 steps x4/3 then x1/3, e.g. 242 -> 323 -> 431 -> 575 -> 767 -> 256.
