  max compound moves 82 at m=919795; time 0.7s
  greedy map G_-(m)=(2^k_min m+1)/3 has cycles with minima <= 10^6: [[4, 11]]
  starts needing a NON-greedy k (BFS over admissible k): 1, namely [(4, 'cycle', [4, 11, 59, 20, 7, 5, 2])]
  (plus side: the greedy map G(m)=(2^k_min m-1)/3 has no cycle with minimum in [2,10^6]; its only
   fixed point is 1 since G(1)=1.)  REFUTED for the minus side: G_-(4)=11, G_-(11)=4.
