S8  Audit-driven additions (2026-09-21): carry formula, peak semantics, tail count, residue-law modulus, GLOBAL cycle-word census, cap sensitivity, E_- rescue word, pn+1 hierarchy
==============================================================================
S8.1 carry formula B_i = sum_{l=1}^{i} 3^(l-1) 2^(K_i-K_l): 3^i m_i = 2^K_i m - B_i checked for
  m <= 3000 (3 not|m), i <= 6: 12000 instances, all exact, all B_i > 0; the draft's reversed form
  sum_{l=0}^{i-1} 3^(i-1-l) 2^(K_i-K_(l+1)) disagrees in 8679 of them (e.g. word (0,2) from m=4:
  correct B_2 = 4 + 3 = 7 and 9*1 = 16 - 7; the reversed form gives 13).
S8.2 peak semantics at m=797162: E-node peak (all nodes of the E-path 1->m, doubling intermediates
  included) = 150994948 = 4*37748737 = 9*2^24+4; compound-value peak (values m_i only) = 50331649.
  m=244: compound values [244, 325, 433, 577, 769, 256, 85], E-node peak 2308 = 4*577, compound-value peak 769.
S8.3 #{1 <= m <= 10^6, 3 not|m, sigma(m) > 10} = 2044 (this includes the greedy fixed point m = 1 with
  sigma(1) = infinity; 2043 starts m >= 2)  <=  Markov bound (7/9)^9 (2X/3 + 2*3^10) = 81740 (integer part;
  the bound is 40.0 times the truth).
S8.4 J=1: m_J mod 9 is a function of m mod 3^3 (checked all units, lifts t=1,2,4); NOT of m mod 3^2 (witness m=1 vs 10: residues 1 vs 4); law under uniform units mod 3^3 = 2/9 on {1,4,7}, 1/9 on {2,5,8}.
S8.4 J=2: m_J mod 9 is a function of m mod 3^4 (checked all units, lifts t=1,2,4); NOT of m mod 3^3 (witness m=1 vs 28: residues 1 vs 4); law under uniform units mod 3^4 = 2/9 on {1,4,7}, 1/9 on {2,5,8}.
S8.4 J=3: m_J mod 9 is a function of m mod 3^5 (checked all units, lifts t=1,2,4); NOT of m mod 3^4 (witness m=1 vs 82: residues 1 vs 4); law under uniform units mod 3^5 = 2/9 on {1,4,7}, 1/9 on {2,5,8}.
